{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12886","headline":"送王少府归杭州 · 韩翃","name":"送王少府归杭州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"归舟一路转青苹，更欲随潮向富春。\n吴郡陆机称地主，钱塘苏小是乡亲。\n葛花满把能消酒，栀子同心好赠人。\n早晚重过鱼浦宿，遥怜佳句箧中新。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩翃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12886.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12886","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、据《唐诗鉴赏辞典》（周啸天主编，商务印书馆国际有限公司，2012年1月版）「送王少府归杭州」条，撰者丁　放、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"丁 放"}